WEBVTT

00:14:29.389 --> 00:14:32.423
Oklahomčani koji odlaze u Kaliforniju

00:14:32.423 --> 00:14:34.866
u velikom broju zbog bolje budućnosti.

00:14:34.866 --> 00:14:36.655
Kada pogledamo demografske promene

00:14:36.655 --> 00:14:39.425
ljudi koji dolaze sa zapada,
čini se da to što sada vidimo

00:14:39.443 --> 00:14:42.291
jeste gnev plodova.

00:14:42.291 --> 00:14:44.104
(Smeh)

00:14:44.104 --> 00:14:47.169
(Aplauz)

00:14:47.169 --> 00:14:51.714
Unuci se vraćaju domovini.

00:14:51.714 --> 00:14:53.502
Vi ste bili divna i pažljiva publika

00:14:53.502 --> 00:14:55.953
Hvala mnogo što ste me pozvali.

00:14:55.953 --> 00:14:58.496
(Aplauz)